  array([[9, 9, 9],
         [9, 9, 9]], dtype=int32)>

  `tf.fill` evaluates at graph runtime and supports dynamic shapes based on
  other runtime `tf.Tensors`, unlike `tf.constant(value, shape=dims)`, which
  embeds the value as a `Const` node.

